<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>AUC-ROC</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h3>AUC-ROC</h3>
    <p>How well the model tells the two classes apart.</p>
    <p>1.0 is perfect. 0.5 means it is guessing.</p>
    <p>Unlike accuracy, this number does not change when you move the yes/no cut-off.</p>
</body>
</html>
